OL,3,GNEWSARecycling plant reopened after
OL,4,A#12m redevelopment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA multi-million redevelopment of a
OL,7,Fwaste facility will help "power a new
OL,8,Fera of recycling", a council said after
OL,9,Fannouncing the work had been completed.
OL,11,FBiffa's Masons Materials Recovery
OL,12,FFacility (MRF), in Great Blakenham,
OL,13,FSuffolk, was transformed to support
OL,14,FSuffolk County Council's new way of
OL,15,Frecycling rubbish.
OL,17,FThe site can now process glass bottles
OL,18,Fand jars and tackle fires caused by
OL,19,Fdiscarded vapes and batteries, thanks
OL,20,Fto its new fire detection and
OL,21,Fsuppression systems.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
