OL,3,GNEWSARecycling plant reopened after
OL,4,A#12m redevelopment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority said the completion of
OL,7,Fthe #12m project would make recycling
OL,8,Ffor residents in the county - as well
OL,9,Fas Braintree in Essex - "easier and
OL,10,Fmore convenient".
